# Allowlist: the image builds (deploy/docker/) need only the Rust workspace and
# the web console sources. Everything else stays out of the build context,
# above all target/ (hundreds of GB) and web/node_modules.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!.cargo/
!crates/
!xtask/
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/
web/e2e-results/
web/.tanstack/
**/*.sqlite3
